<title>AUSTRIA: Libya expects OPEC quota committee to meet Tues 09.</title>
<headline>Libya expects OPEC quota committee to meet Tues 09.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libyan oil minister Abdullah Salem al-Badri said on Monday that he expected the OPEC quota quota compliance committe meeting will be postponed until 0900 gmt Tuesday.</p>
<p>The meeting was originally scheduled for 1300 gmt on Monday.</p>
<p>He said the postponement was likely as Nigerian oil minister Dan Etete had not yet arrived here. Etete is expected in Vienna later today.</p>
</text>
